  "reviewedChanges": [
    "Gateway OAuth adds explicit login/read/cancel request methods and a status notification; the adapter calls none of these and rejects auth recovery requests or notices.",
    "Initialize capabilities adds optional explicitGatewayOauth; xcb sets true so authorization requires an explicit host action.",
